  "releaseNotes": "## v1.0.0\n\nFirst release. Marketplace order ingestion over a secret-authenticated webhook, trial and purchase lifecycle state on UTC boundaries, contact resolution by email with optional AI Capture, masked license keys with a manager-only reveal, and two outbound CRM webhook events (`license.order_received`, `license.trial_started`).\n\nRequires Oqtane 10.2.6 and StudioElf CRM 1.6.0 or later. One migration runs automatically on the first start after install.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Ingest Oqtane Marketplace orders over one secret-authenticated webhook, track licence and trial lifecycle against UTC boundaries, match buyers to CRM contacts, and keep licence keys masked behind a manager-only reveal. Built for Oqtane 10.2.6 and StudioElf CRM 1.6.0.",
